      "title": "test: make linuxBind tests pass on machines with SELinux",
      "body": "Similar to https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/src/commit/c07a9b3669dc64d498273d47ce0e6974718792f1/act/runner/action.go#L507, add the :z modifier when SELinux is enabled. I am on openSUSE and the `linuxBind` tests only pass with this modifier.\n\n\n## Checklist\n\n### Compliance\n\n- [x] I confirm that I make this contribution in accordance with [Forgejo's AI Agreement](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/governance/src/commit/9084720dc6a7fbf1d3f358919d46bd6adfb55287/AIAgreement.md).\n\n<!--start release-notes-assistant-->\n<!--URL:https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner-->\n- other\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1791): <!--number 1791 --><!--line 0 --><!--description dGVzdDogbWFrZSBsaW51eEJpbmQgdGVzdHMgcGFzcyBvbiBtYWNoaW5lcyB3aXRoIFNFTGludXg=-->test: make linuxBind tests pass on machines with SELinux<!--description-->\n<!--end release-notes-assistant-->\n",
